WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 20]

01:39.480 --> 01:40.060
Nichang,

01:40.320 --> 01:42.100
why stop me from leading the disciples?

01:42.710 --> 01:43.850
Do you really think if we don't fight back,

01:44.190 --> 01:45.330
the demonic sects will spare us?

01:48.000 --> 01:48.540
Look at you.

01:48.800 --> 01:49.650
You're good at everything,

01:49.880 --> 01:51.380
except knowing when to quit.

01:52.350 --> 01:53.140
The Six Demonic Sects are too powerful.

01:53.870 --> 01:54.900
We, the Seven Sects, can't compare.

01:56.030 --> 01:57.420
Even if we give it our all,

01:57.760 --> 01:58.620
we still won't stand a chance.

01:59.440 --> 02:00.370
Better to hold our ground

02:00.710 --> 02:01.580
and preserve our strength.

02:02.870 --> 02:04.620
They're after cultivation resources.

02:05.320 --> 02:06.740
They likely won't come after us.

02:07.030 --> 02:07.530
Nichang,

02:08.000 --> 02:09.090
if they take the Yue Kingdom

02:09.670 --> 02:11.820
and start rounding up spirit-rooted mortals,

02:12.280 --> 02:13.130
then what?

02:13.560 --> 02:15.130
I don't know if that counts as resources,

02:15.750 --> 02:16.330
but I do know

02:17.150 --> 02:18.180
we can't just stand by.

02:19.070 --> 02:20.330
Aren't you afraid that if we go too far,

02:20.790 --> 02:22.730
some Nascent Soul elder will step in

02:23.110 --> 02:24.370
and get someone you care about killed?

02:25.200 --> 02:25.820
That won't happen.

02:26.710 --> 02:27.410
When in doubt,

02:27.560 --> 02:28.330
retreat first.

02:28.960 --> 02:29.540
Besides,

02:30.320 --> 02:31.330
most Nascent Soul cultivators

02:31.750 --> 02:32.900
don't bother with worldly affairs.

02:33.320 --> 02:34.120
They won't waste time

02:34.150 --> 02:35.330
coming after us.

02:36.790 --> 02:38.180
Since logic won't work, I'll just tell you.

02:38.710 --> 02:39.860
The demonic sects run wild.

02:40.480 --> 02:42.100
But do you know why none of the Nascent Soul elders

02:42.120 --> 02:43.100
from the Seven Sects are stepping in?

02:44.400 --> 02:45.210
Simple.

02:47.120 --> 02:48.570
They know they'll lose.

02:54.350 --> 02:55.660
In the cultivation world, strength rules.

02:56.510 --> 02:57.330
Below Nascent Soul,

02:57.640 --> 02:58.490
we're all ants.

02:59.230 --> 03:00.740
Our elders once fought

03:01.590 --> 03:02.850
Grandmaster Yunlu

03:03.230 --> 03:05.020
of the Six Demonic Sects.

03:05.430 --> 03:06.210
They lost.

03:07.000 --> 03:08.290
To avoid a larger war,

03:09.000 --> 03:10.740
they cut a deal and both sides agreed:

03:11.510 --> 03:12.660
No Nascent Soul cultivators

03:13.070 --> 03:14.570
can join this war.

03:16.070 --> 03:17.130
So it's true.

03:18.640 --> 03:20.210
I thought the war had just begun,

03:21.790 --> 03:23.020
but it was already over.

03:24.680 --> 03:25.900
Peace lasted too long.

03:26.870 --> 03:28.020
We're like kids flashing treasure,

03:28.400 --> 03:29.260
just asking to get robbed.

03:30.350 --> 03:31.290
It's not just the demonic sects.

03:32.310 --> 03:33.850
Even the Righteous Alliance is eyeing us.

03:34.310 --> 03:35.970
They're all waiting for the demonic sects to invade Yue,

03:36.510 --> 03:38.500
so they can swoop in

03:38.680 --> 03:40.130
while we bleed.

03:41.560 --> 03:42.290
Nichang,

03:43.350 --> 03:45.170
are you really going to watch

03:45.590 --> 03:46.540
as Yue Kingdom burns?

03:49.030 --> 03:50.290
I knew you'd say that.

03:51.030 --> 03:51.780
So,

03:52.150 --> 03:53.220
I'm giving you one year.

03:53.400 --> 03:54.410
One year?

03:55.710 --> 03:56.540
For one year,

03:57.000 --> 03:57.890
whatever you want to do,

03:58.430 --> 03:59.940
slay demons or save mortals,

04:01.120 --> 04:02.380
I won't interfere.

04:03.430 --> 04:04.010
But,

04:04.630 --> 04:06.340
the sect won't offer much support.

04:07.240 --> 04:08.850
The Grand Elder made the decision.

04:09.910 --> 04:11.010
I can't go against it too far.

04:15.240 --> 04:16.260
Your words

04:17.560 --> 04:18.500
are more than enough for me.

04:24.080 --> 04:24.890
Take care of yourself.

04:35.150 --> 04:36.220
If the outcome

04:36.310 --> 04:37.450
is already set,

04:37.960 --> 04:38.780
then my duty

04:39.280 --> 04:40.380
is to save

04:40.630 --> 04:41.570
as many as I can.

04:42.030 --> 04:42.610
Nichang,

04:43.000 --> 04:44.170
I'll make the most of this year

04:44.240 --> 04:45.340
you've given me.

04:54.780 --> 04:58.660
[Golden Drum Plains, One year later]

04:59.360 --> 05:01.500
The Seven Sects are getting cocky lately.

05:02.750 --> 05:03.570
This month alone,

05:03.720 --> 05:05.500
we've lost over twenty men.

05:06.470 --> 05:07.780
Eyes wide, all of you.

05:08.120 --> 05:09.500
Don't walk into their ambushes!

05:10.910 --> 05:11.780
No way.

05:12.030 --> 05:13.170
In broad daylight?

05:13.780 --> 05:14.460
♪Heaven and Earth, the sacred path♪

05:14.660 --> 05:15.340
♪The root of all creation♪

05:15.420 --> 05:16.180
♪Through endless trials I train♪

05:16.260 --> 05:16.980
♪To awaken my true power♪

05:17.020 --> 05:17.740
♪Within and beyond all realms♪

05:17.900 --> 05:18.540
♪Only the Dao stands above♪

05:18.700 --> 05:19.420
♪Golden light surrounds me♪

05:19.500 --> 05:20.180
♪Wrapping me in its glow♪

05:20.300 --> 05:21.020
♪It can't be seen♪

05:21.060 --> 05:21.780
♪It can't be heard♪

05:21.900 --> 05:22.620
♪It holds the world♪

05:22.700 --> 05:23.420
♪And gives life to all♪

05:23.540 --> 05:24.300
♪Chanted a thousand times♪

05:24.420 --> 05:25.100
♪It makes my spirit shine♪

05:25.180 --> 05:25.900
♪The Three Realms guard my path♪

05:25.980 --> 05:26.700
♪The Five Emperors guide me♪

05:27.180 --> 05:27.900
♪All the immortal bow♪

05:27.980 --> 05:28.700
♪Even thunder serves me♪

05:28.820 --> 05:29.500
♪All the immortal bow♪

05:29.620 --> 05:30.340
♪Even thunder serves me♪

05:30.740 --> 05:31.460
♪Demons tremble in fear♪

05:31.500 --> 05:32.220
♪Spirits are out of my sight♪

05:32.500 --> 05:33.180
♪Demons tremble in fear♪

05:33.300 --> 05:33.980
♪Spirits are out of my sight♪

05:34.140 --> 05:34.860
♪Thunder resides in me♪

05:34.980 --> 05:35.700
♪With the lightning's name sealed♪

05:35.740 --> 05:36.500
♪Wisdom flows through me♪

05:36.540 --> 05:37.260
♪Five forces rise from within♪

05:37.380 --> 05:38.060
♪Golden rays blaze out♪

05:38.180 --> 05:38.860
♪And shields me from all harm♪

05:39.100 --> 05:40.580
♪And shields me from all harm♪

05:41.500 --> 05:42.340
♪The way of Heaven and Earth♪

05:42.700 --> 05:44.380
♪I swear to crush all evil♪

05:44.980 --> 05:45.700
♪Blood may stain my robe♪

05:46.220 --> 05:47.940
♪But who can see the truth?♪

05:48.300 --> 05:49.140
♪I won't let the world decide♪

05:49.500 --> 05:51.300
♪What I must look like♪

05:51.740 --> 05:52.620
♪I'll show what I'm made of♪

05:52.900 --> 05:54.740
♪And break through every trap♪

05:55.060 --> 05:56.300
♪Swinging my sword at sorrow♪

05:56.660 --> 05:58.100
♪My will stays unshaken♪

05:58.420 --> 05:59.660
♪The road is full of perils...♪

06:01.240 --> 06:02.220
What's with the demonic sects?

06:03.190 --> 06:04.170
Lately, the ones they send

06:05.000 --> 06:06.540
are all nobodies.

06:06.700 --> 06:08.420
♪Leave behind a fearless soul♪

06:08.420 --> 06:10.220
[Han Li, Mid Foundation Establishment Stage]

06:10.220 --> 06:11.020
♪Through endless trials I train♪

06:11.100 --> 06:11.820
♪To awaken my true power♪

06:11.860 --> 06:12.620
♪Within and beyond all realms♪

06:12.660 --> 06:13.420
♪Only the Dao stands above♪

06:13.500 --> 06:14.260
♪Golden light surrounds me♪

06:14.340 --> 06:15.060
♪Wrapping me in its glow♪

06:15.100 --> 06:15.860
♪It can't be seen♪

06:15.900 --> 06:16.660
♪It can't be heard♪

06:16.740 --> 06:17.500
♪It holds the world♪

06:17.540 --> 06:18.300
♪And gives life to all♪

06:26.680 --> 06:28.050
Since the Yan Clan Stronghold incident,

06:29.190 --> 06:29.900
this war

06:31.190 --> 06:32.100
has been going on for a year.

06:38.430 --> 06:38.980
The battles

06:39.390 --> 06:41.170
have shifted from large-scale attacks

06:41.920 --> 06:43.540
to a prolonged stalemate.

06:44.870 --> 06:46.700
Once the Seven Sects moved to defense,

06:47.160 --> 06:49.410
many former rear-line regions

06:49.830 --> 06:51.810
were exposed to fierce assaults by the demonic sects' forces.

07:27.750 --> 07:29.610
Compared to their endless waves of troops,

07:30.270 --> 07:31.580
our reinforcements

07:32.000 --> 07:32.730
are far fewer.

07:33.800 --> 07:34.730
Mostly Foundation Establishment

07:35.310 --> 07:36.490
and Qi Refining Stage cultivators.

07:37.800 --> 07:39.050
Core Formation cultivators on both sides

07:39.270 --> 07:41.170
seem to be staying out of it.

07:41.950 --> 07:43.660
But sneak attacks,

07:43.920 --> 07:44.460
duels,

07:44.750 --> 07:45.900
and even assassinations

07:46.240 --> 07:47.370
among disciples are nonstop.

07:58.560 --> 07:59.660
All my seniors

07:59.800 --> 08:01.220
fought in the big battle early this year.

08:02.040 --> 08:02.930
Making it out alive

08:03.750 --> 08:04.460
was no small feat.

08:08.310 --> 08:09.100
To me,

08:09.750 --> 08:10.980
this is a good chance

08:11.360 --> 08:12.610
to stabilize my cultivation and sharpen my skills.

08:13.480 --> 08:14.850
I even picked up some gems and artifacts.

08:17.190 --> 08:18.370
But fighting like this,

08:19.510 --> 08:20.780
will it really lead anywhere?

09:35.120 --> 09:36.220
Remember the royal heirs

09:36.950 --> 09:38.610
from the Jiang and Cheqi Kingdoms?

09:39.830 --> 09:41.370
I've arranged a way out for them.

09:42.560 --> 09:43.340
Now it's up to you

09:44.360 --> 09:46.050
to escort them somewhere safe.

09:47.240 --> 09:47.980
Where are we taking them?

09:48.560 --> 09:49.340
To the Nine Kingdoms Alliance.

09:51.560 --> 09:53.810
So you already found an escape route for our sect?

10:00.040 --> 10:00.580
Only moving forward

10:01.120 --> 10:01.490
and never retreating,

10:02.070 --> 10:04.020
that'll cost us dearly.

10:08.030 --> 10:09.850
You think one step back leads to peace?

10:10.720 --> 10:11.770
For the Seven Sects,

10:12.080 --> 10:12.940
it means nothing but ruin.

10:13.870 --> 10:14.980
Those old geezers

10:15.200 --> 10:17.130
probably secured their own exit long ago.

10:18.030 --> 10:18.820
It's just a shame

10:19.550 --> 10:20.890
the ordinary disciples

10:21.670 --> 10:22.650
are dying on the frontlines

10:23.240 --> 10:24.010
for nothing.

10:25.630 --> 10:27.340
Moonshadow Sect will survive

10:27.510 --> 10:28.890
under the Sect Leader's guidance.

10:29.600 --> 10:30.370
But me,

10:31.000 --> 10:32.340
I'm just a noisy bird,

10:33.000 --> 10:34.610
chirping away

10:35.240 --> 10:36.890
yet unable to change anything.

10:37.750 --> 10:39.180
I can't save anyone either.

10:46.550 --> 10:47.130
Han Li...

10:52.440 --> 10:53.650
I shouldn't be thinking of him.

10:56.870 --> 10:57.850
Where did you run off to?

10:58.320 --> 10:59.180
Where were you?

11:00.200 --> 11:00.980
We're still in the middle of a war,

11:01.480 --> 11:02.300
yet you lofty types

11:02.720 --> 11:03.300
just vanish?

11:03.870 --> 11:05.250
I've held this in for so long.

11:07.600 --> 11:08.610
Since we'll never meet again,

11:09.440 --> 11:10.460
I might as well get it off my chest.

11:12.080 --> 11:13.060
You're finally willing to talk to me?

11:15.630 --> 11:16.420
As long as you're willing to speak,

11:17.440 --> 11:18.060
I don't care what it's about.

11:19.750 --> 11:20.650
Before the war started,

11:21.670 --> 11:22.730
the Seven Sects and the demonic sects

11:22.750 --> 11:23.940
signed a secret deal.

11:26.150 --> 11:27.770
Don't say stuff that sensitive out loud.

11:29.910 --> 11:30.730
At this point,

11:31.320 --> 11:32.700
the whole war is following that deal.

11:33.120 --> 11:34.130
The Seven Sects surrendered.

11:36.550 --> 11:37.850
Gave in before the fighting even started?

11:40.910 --> 11:42.010
That's not like you.

11:42.200 --> 11:43.180
The agreement states

11:43.670 --> 11:44.490
only cultivators

11:44.510 --> 11:46.610
below Nascent Soul can take part in this war.

11:47.080 --> 11:47.650
Which means

11:48.360 --> 11:49.530
I can't save everyone.

11:50.440 --> 11:51.700
We low-level disciples

11:52.240 --> 11:53.460
are still fighting like fools.

11:54.000 --> 11:55.010
People die every day.

11:56.870 --> 11:58.420
And you already knew how it would end?

11:59.240 --> 12:00.220
It's just not fair!

12:01.670 --> 12:03.340
War isn't a game for low-level disciples,

12:05.390 --> 12:07.130
yet they always pay the price.

12:08.910 --> 12:10.220
Three hundred years I've lived,

12:11.320 --> 12:12.250
and I still don't understand it.

12:13.840 --> 12:14.700
It's pathetic.

12:32.440 --> 12:33.010
Don't cry.

12:34.030 --> 12:34.770
You did nothing wrong.

12:42.360 --> 12:43.340
I couldn't stop it.

12:44.270 --> 12:45.730
I couldn't stop anything.

12:51.270 --> 12:51.890
Don't cry.

12:52.910 --> 12:53.490
I'm here.

12:56.630 --> 12:57.490
Where are you?

13:00.240 --> 13:00.770
Right here.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.060
Right here?

13:26.910 --> 13:27.850
Grandmaster,

13:28.390 --> 13:30.340
you haven't moved for three days.

13:32.270 --> 13:33.060
Are we almost there?

13:33.840 --> 13:35.890
One hour to Golden Drum Plains.

13:45.670 --> 13:46.340
Elder Chen,

13:46.910 --> 13:47.420
this stuff

13:47.550 --> 13:48.530
was left behind

13:48.870 --> 13:50.170
by the Foundation Establishment demonic cultivator

13:50.240 --> 13:51.460
that we three took down today.

13:54.200 --> 13:55.100
He was cunning,

13:55.720 --> 13:56.770
and almost got away.

13:57.080 --> 13:57.580
Luckily,

13:57.750 --> 13:58.460
the three of us

13:58.600 --> 13:59.580
worked seamlessly together.

13:59.750 --> 14:00.420
That's right.

14:00.790 --> 14:01.850
We just got lucky,

14:02.030 --> 14:02.940
finding one traveling alone.

14:03.270 --> 14:04.180
Last time I went solo,

14:04.360 --> 14:06.010
I had to take on several demonic cultivators.

14:06.600 --> 14:07.460
This is our first time here.

14:08.000 --> 14:08.890
Let's all keep a low profile.

14:10.510 --> 14:11.530
Why is she everywhere?

14:13.320 --> 14:13.980
Han Li!

14:16.480 --> 14:17.610
Long time no see!

14:24.030 --> 14:24.650
Han Li,

14:26.320 --> 14:28.420
did you bring me another round of generous gifts?

14:40.320 --> 14:40.820
Nice job.

14:41.270 --> 14:42.010
In just three days,

14:42.550 --> 14:43.400
you crushed five Qi Refining ones,

14:43.630 --> 14:44.420
and a Foundation Establishment one,

14:45.030 --> 14:46.700
all from the toughest Demonic Flame Sect.

14:48.630 --> 14:49.130
Here,

14:50.030 --> 14:51.340
this is your merit jade slip.

14:52.320 --> 14:53.420
Are you using your war credits

14:53.870 --> 14:54.980
to trade for ancient texts again?

14:56.000 --> 14:56.610
Appreciate it.

15:04.600 --> 15:05.460
Han,

15:08.030 --> 15:09.250
long time no word from you.

15:09.480 --> 15:10.460
Didn't expect to see you here.

15:11.720 --> 15:12.580
It's been years, Senior Chen.

15:13.030 --> 15:13.940
Hope you've been well.

15:15.550 --> 15:16.300
You too.

15:16.600 --> 15:17.850
Your cultivation's clearly come a long way.

15:18.440 --> 15:18.980
Congrats

15:19.550 --> 15:21.130
on taking down a Foundation Establishment demonic cultivator.

15:22.480 --> 15:23.300
I just got lucky.

15:23.840 --> 15:24.980
At least I didn't come back empty-handed.

15:27.750 --> 15:28.650
That's the second time

15:28.670 --> 15:30.300
I've taken down someone at my level.

15:31.480 --> 15:31.980
Congrats.

15:33.320 --> 15:33.850
I've got things to do.

15:34.000 --> 15:34.490
Excuse me.

15:40.720 --> 15:41.730
Why do I feel like

15:41.960 --> 15:43.010
Han Li's not the same guy

15:43.080 --> 15:43.980
he used to be?

15:44.840 --> 15:46.060
Feels like

15:46.440 --> 15:47.770
he looks down on us now.

15:48.870 --> 15:50.190
Well, he's following Mentor Li now.

15:50.360 --> 15:51.460
Of course he won't bother with us.

15:53.150 --> 15:54.060
Mentor Li

15:54.240 --> 15:55.300
has always taken in

15:55.320 --> 15:56.890
those rootless disciples like him.

15:57.270 --> 15:57.890
Weird old man.

15:58.270 --> 15:58.850
Enough already.

15:59.600 --> 16:00.420
Where are your manners?

16:01.240 --> 16:02.100
I didn't mean it like that.

16:02.720 --> 16:03.340
I just meant

16:04.360 --> 16:05.490
that the guy

16:05.550 --> 16:07.180
was acting all high and mighty.

16:08.510 --> 16:09.610
But he's no different from us,

16:10.120 --> 16:10.980
just killed

16:11.240 --> 16:12.610
a Foundation Establishment demonic cultivator.

16:12.990 --> 16:14.210
What's there to brag about?

16:16.080 --> 16:17.460
Here's your war credit record.

16:17.870 --> 16:18.940
Take it and go.

16:19.240 --> 16:20.130
You're just making a scene.

16:22.790 --> 16:23.460
Elder Chen,

16:24.120 --> 16:25.530
you're a Chen family elder.

16:26.510 --> 16:27.490
Why are you treating outsiders

16:27.600 --> 16:28.650
better than us?

16:29.080 --> 16:29.770
Don't tell me

16:29.840 --> 16:31.100
he killed a Core Formation cultivator?

16:31.870 --> 16:33.060
Don't be ridiculous.

16:34.030 --> 16:35.460
He clearly took out

16:35.480 --> 16:37.220
someone on our level.

16:37.870 --> 16:38.220
Then,

16:38.270 --> 16:40.060
why are you all warm smiles to him?

16:40.120 --> 16:41.420
And cold glares to us?

16:41.630 --> 16:42.340
That's Han Li's

16:42.550 --> 16:43.650
seventeenth

16:43.840 --> 16:44.980
Foundation Establishment-level kill.

16:45.390 --> 16:46.530
His war record is outstanding.

16:47.270 --> 16:50.460
Seventeen kills?

16:50.870 --> 16:52.010
No way!

16:53.000 --> 16:54.890
You three just got your second one,

16:55.320 --> 16:56.730
and it took all three of you.

16:57.480 --> 16:58.340
Still yapping?

16:59.150 --> 17:00.250
Thick-skinned, aren't you?

17:00.790 --> 17:01.460
Bro...

17:02.510 --> 17:03.890
No way.

17:04.480 --> 17:05.220
Qiaoqian,

17:05.960 --> 17:07.010
if you ask me,

17:07.510 --> 17:08.460
Han Li's got solid skills

17:09.080 --> 17:09.850
and knows when to hold back.

17:10.790 --> 17:12.100
He's got a bright future.

17:13.120 --> 17:14.010
If you've got any ties

17:14.600 --> 17:15.130
to him,

17:15.640 --> 17:16.890
don't let go.

17:17.960 --> 17:19.850
Recruit more talents like him.

17:20.560 --> 17:21.700
They'll be a great asset

17:22.070 --> 17:22.930
to our family.

17:28.200 --> 17:29.180
Got it, Elder Chen.

17:37.240 --> 17:39.100
I haven't even tried out the high-grade furnace

17:39.600 --> 17:40.610
I traded for last time.

17:41.550 --> 17:42.100
Time to give it a go.

17:53.840 --> 17:54.770
Lust Powder...

17:57.480 --> 17:58.420
Soul-Stealing Incense...

18:00.200 --> 18:01.940
What twisted demonic recipes!

18:08.480 --> 18:09.130
Ageless Pill?

18:10.440 --> 18:11.250
Keeping you young

18:11.390 --> 18:12.370
and never aging.

18:13.510 --> 18:14.100
Now that one

18:14.670 --> 18:15.300
may be worth a try.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.010
Han.

18:49.640 --> 18:50.810
It's much easier to talk like this.

18:53.400 --> 18:54.090
Congrats.

18:54.350 --> 18:55.330
You've earned a mountain of war credits.

18:55.880 --> 18:56.770
I'm genuinely envious.

18:59.640 --> 19:00.470
If I remember right,

19:00.550 --> 19:02.490
we joined the sect around the same time.

19:06.070 --> 19:07.090
But in terms of cultivation,

19:07.350 --> 19:08.530
you're way ahead of me now.

19:09.160 --> 19:10.140
Still regarding you as my junior

19:10.440 --> 19:11.810
feels a bit off, doesn't it?

19:13.640 --> 19:14.180
It's fine.

19:15.160 --> 19:16.180
I'm used to it anyway.

19:17.160 --> 19:18.220
Once you break through again,

19:18.550 --> 19:19.730
then I can change it.

19:20.750 --> 19:22.140
Call me however you like, Senior.

19:22.440 --> 19:22.980
I don't mind.

19:23.720 --> 19:24.980
Did you need something here?

19:25.510 --> 19:26.420
Han,

19:27.240 --> 19:28.090
are you aware

19:29.960 --> 19:30.980
of our Chen family's standing?

19:31.880 --> 19:32.700
I'd like to invite you

19:32.790 --> 19:34.330
to serve as our guest elder.

19:35.680 --> 19:36.460
Here's the deposit.

19:36.720 --> 19:37.570
You'll also get annual tribute later on.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.140
Senior, I can't accept that.

19:40.000 --> 19:40.860
My cultivation is still low,

19:41.400 --> 19:42.220
and my talent's poor.

19:43.000 --> 19:43.730
Even though

19:43.960 --> 19:45.330
I've reached Foundation Establishment by sheer luck with fake spirit roots,

19:45.720 --> 19:46.420
if anything major

19:46.640 --> 19:47.620
comes up,

19:48.440 --> 19:49.010
I may drag

19:49.240 --> 19:50.140
your clan down.

19:51.790 --> 19:52.250
Senior Chen,

19:53.240 --> 19:54.140
I don't think I'm qualified

19:54.750 --> 19:55.770
to serve as a guest elder.

19:56.830 --> 19:57.420
And I can't accept

19:58.110 --> 19:58.770
these gems.

20:04.550 --> 20:05.290
Wait, it's her?

20:12.160 --> 20:12.810
Han.

20:17.310 --> 20:17.770
Take it.

20:18.640 --> 20:19.330
You should keep it!

20:19.400 --> 20:20.050
I really can't.

20:22.240 --> 20:23.140
Just keep it!

20:36.720 --> 20:37.490
Young Master,

20:37.590 --> 20:38.330
you're truly wise and valiant,

20:38.510 --> 20:39.140
brilliant beyond compare,

20:39.310 --> 20:40.050
sharp-eyed and strategic,

20:40.110 --> 20:40.810
always scheming,

20:41.000 --> 20:41.810
meticulously plotting...

20:42.240 --> 20:42.940
Shut your mouth.

20:45.960 --> 20:46.940
Any news on that person?

20:47.640 --> 20:48.290
Reporting, Young Master.

20:48.920 --> 20:49.490
He's gone.

20:50.790 --> 20:51.290
Gone?

20:52.070 --> 20:52.490
Gone!

20:53.510 --> 20:54.180
Well, I mean,

20:54.400 --> 20:56.250
who knows exactly where he's gone!

20:56.440 --> 20:57.730
No need to worry, Young Master.

20:59.310 --> 21:00.490
I'm not worried?

21:02.030 --> 21:03.010
Then you're going to worry for me?

21:08.750 --> 21:10.090
What's beyond the sea?

21:11.000 --> 21:11.730
Aren't you curious?

21:13.640 --> 21:14.900
The world across the sea?

21:15.680 --> 21:16.490
I've looked into it for ages,

21:17.110 --> 21:18.090
but I still can't figure out

21:18.590 --> 21:20.460
where that array leads.

21:23.920 --> 21:24.620
He's over there.

21:25.880 --> 21:26.530
Han!

21:26.720 --> 21:27.250
We're here!

21:29.480 --> 21:30.050
Han!

21:38.240 --> 21:38.900
Impressive!

21:40.270 --> 21:40.730
Seniors,

21:41.000 --> 21:41.380
it's been

21:41.750 --> 21:42.330
a while.

21:43.680 --> 21:44.330
Who says we missed you?

21:48.960 --> 21:49.420
Han,

21:50.350 --> 21:51.290
if you've got no feelings

21:51.680 --> 21:53.250
for Dong Xuan'er,

21:53.550 --> 21:54.810
then let her go to Wu Xuan.

21:56.480 --> 21:57.570
You idiot.

21:58.000 --> 21:59.620
You can't "let go" of someone you like.

22:00.920 --> 22:01.490
Han,

22:02.110 --> 22:03.140
don't blame him.

22:03.830 --> 22:04.620
He's upset

22:04.920 --> 22:05.800
probably because

22:05.800 --> 22:06.940
Xuan'er gave him

22:07.240 --> 22:08.090
the cold shoulder.

22:09.960 --> 22:10.810
Dong's here too?

22:13.720 --> 22:14.770
Xuan'er told me

22:15.400 --> 22:16.290
not to tell you.

22:16.880 --> 22:17.420
She's been grounded

22:17.550 --> 22:19.530
by Mentor Hongfu for quite a while now.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.140
Why'd you suddenly bring her up?

22:26.000 --> 22:26.530
Weiniang,

22:27.350 --> 22:28.330
stop teasing fellow disciples.

22:29.960 --> 22:30.530
Han,

22:31.030 --> 22:31.770
it's not just us who came,

22:32.200 --> 22:33.380
our master is here at Golden Drum Plains too.

22:33.880 --> 22:35.010
He's looking for you right now.

22:38.350 --> 22:38.900
Senior,

22:39.480 --> 22:40.090
did Master mention

22:40.240 --> 22:40.900
the reason?

22:41.480 --> 22:43.010
Not exactly.

22:43.960 --> 22:45.420
He just said it's something important.

22:47.030 --> 22:47.730
You'd better go.

22:52.960 --> 22:54.460
Even someone like Master, a Core Formation cultivator,

22:54.880 --> 22:55.940
came here personally to hold the line.

22:56.790 --> 22:58.140
And he brought so many elite disciples too.

22:59.000 --> 23:00.090
Looks like things here

23:00.680 --> 23:01.490
are getting worse.

23:02.440 --> 23:03.620
This place won't stay safe for long.

23:04.350 --> 23:05.220
I need to start planning ahead.

23:07.440 --> 23:08.620
Young Master, your concerns are perfectly valid!

23:10.350 --> 23:10.770
Stupid rock!

23:10.920 --> 23:11.390
Evil rock!

23:11.400 --> 23:12.090
You tripped our Young Master again...

23:12.110 --> 23:12.660
Get over here!

23:14.350 --> 23:14.930
Young Master,

23:15.160 --> 23:16.010
let's pull back.

23:16.310 --> 23:17.660
We've already captured a few

23:17.920 --> 23:18.730
from the Seven Sects.

23:18.880 --> 23:19.460
We may get

23:19.460 --> 23:21.140
that brat's location out of them.

23:30.310 --> 23:31.290
It's her...

23:53.400 --> 23:54.490
It really is you!

23:55.200 --> 23:55.900
What a coincidence.

23:56.790 --> 23:57.220
Look,

23:58.030 --> 23:58.980
of all the places,

24:00.480 --> 24:01.730
we ran into each other.

24:02.550 --> 24:03.900
You're really here for me?

24:05.550 --> 24:06.620
Let me take a good look at you.

24:12.920 --> 24:13.810
Don't give me that look.

24:14.830 --> 24:15.860
Your enchantment doesn't work on me anymore.

24:20.680 --> 24:21.810
Let me really get a good look.

24:23.000 --> 24:24.010
Not bad.

24:25.680 --> 24:26.620
Really not bad.

24:33.590 --> 24:34.220
"Yun"...

24:37.240 --> 24:38.010
Isn't it funny

24:38.030 --> 24:39.420
how good my instincts are?

24:40.030 --> 24:41.050
From the moment I saw you,

24:41.200 --> 24:42.330
everything clicked!

24:44.350 --> 24:45.180
Why aren't you saying anything?

24:46.750 --> 24:47.220
Oh, yes.

24:47.350 --> 24:47.660
Speak up.

24:48.920 --> 24:49.680
You freak,

24:49.720 --> 24:51.620
drop your spell and let me go now!

24:52.790 --> 24:54.140
Wow, that mouth of yours.

24:54.880 --> 24:55.660
Who are you calling a freak?

24:57.310 --> 24:58.330
Technically,

24:58.550 --> 25:00.220
you should call me cousin, you know?

25:01.270 --> 25:02.180
Back at Yan Clan Stronghold,

25:02.440 --> 25:03.980
if that guy hadn't shown up,

25:04.440 --> 25:05.460
I would've already claimed you.

25:06.440 --> 25:08.290
Who wants to be family with a freak like you?

25:08.590 --> 25:09.730
My master is Fairy Hongfu,

25:09.750 --> 25:11.610
the top Core Formation cultivator in Yellow Maple Valley!

25:11.640 --> 25:12.180
Hold up...

25:13.480 --> 25:14.050
Fairy Hongfu?

25:15.480 --> 25:16.420
She's your master?

25:16.620 --> 25:17.220
Guess I hit a nerve.

25:19.590 --> 25:20.420
So Fairy Hongfu

25:21.260 --> 25:22.520
never told you about him?

25:25.070 --> 25:26.290
She said nothing,

25:26.480 --> 25:27.810
but still had you wear this.

25:28.590 --> 25:29.330
That means,

25:29.590 --> 25:30.620
after all these years,

25:30.920 --> 25:32.420
she still can't forget him.

25:34.680 --> 25:35.620
She really had something with that guy.

25:36.510 --> 25:37.660
What are you mumbling about?

25:37.960 --> 25:38.490
I don't understand a word.

25:39.350 --> 25:40.180
Let me go already!

25:40.790 --> 25:41.980
No can do.

25:43.720 --> 25:44.620
Joyful Union Sect

25:45.350 --> 25:47.570
owed Ghost Spirit Sect a big favor.

25:48.160 --> 25:49.140
What exactly are you planning?

25:52.270 --> 25:53.180
Taking you to meet your kin.

25:55.590 --> 25:56.010
Let's go.

25:57.830 --> 25:58.530
Let me go!

25:58.790 --> 25:59.290
You freak!

25:59.440 --> 26:00.420
Where are you taking me?

26:05.830 --> 26:06.570
Wangyu,

26:07.030 --> 26:08.530
you're such a shameless rip-off!

26:09.620 --> 26:09.920
Throwing your weight around!

26:09.620 --> 26:13.420
Your Treasure House

26:13.640 --> 26:14.420
has branches everywhere,

26:14.440 --> 26:15.700
yet you're squeezing us

26:16.000 --> 26:17.220
over a few war credits?

26:17.680 --> 26:18.140
Also,

26:18.160 --> 26:18.980
that Freezing Talisman?

26:19.160 --> 26:20.050
Come on,

26:20.070 --> 26:21.860
that thing's everywhere!

26:22.160 --> 26:23.010
It's barely worth two gems!

26:23.030 --> 26:23.490
Two gems!

26:23.830 --> 26:24.570
You know how much he charged?

26:24.960 --> 26:25.460
Twenty!

26:25.510 --> 26:26.090
See that?

26:26.160 --> 26:27.250
Total rip-off!

26:27.440 --> 26:27.860
See what you've done?

26:27.960 --> 26:29.050
Who's the rip-off?

26:29.240 --> 26:30.730
Say that again?

26:32.400 --> 26:34.050
We're at war.

26:34.960 --> 26:36.530
Gems are in short supply.

26:36.640 --> 26:37.330
Prices had to go up.

26:38.200 --> 26:38.860
That takes money.

26:40.510 --> 26:40.980
Moving supplies

26:41.400 --> 26:42.460
to the front?

26:42.880 --> 26:43.770
That takes money too.

26:44.350 --> 26:45.620
Even the demonic sects

26:45.750 --> 26:47.380
come to my shop

26:47.400 --> 26:48.330
to snatch up supplies.

26:49.000 --> 26:51.010
We're way past talking about just cost price.

26:51.030 --> 26:52.330
You two get that?

26:52.350 --> 26:53.290
Get it?

26:53.480 --> 26:54.090
You blockheads.

26:55.070 --> 26:55.420
Hey,

26:55.480 --> 26:55.900
you...

26:56.880 --> 26:58.460
Easy for you to say!

26:59.240 --> 26:59.940
Besides,

27:00.550 --> 27:02.810
you're using war merits to trade for my stuff.

27:03.440 --> 27:04.220
You said

27:04.350 --> 27:06.250
you'll pay up

27:06.270 --> 27:07.700
after beating the demonic sects.

27:07.830 --> 27:09.180
Who's buying that crap?

27:09.200 --> 27:09.900
We'll settle it...

27:09.920 --> 27:11.220
Yeah? When?

27:11.310 --> 27:12.180
In the next lifetime?

27:13.110 --> 27:13.730
So yes,

27:14.200 --> 27:16.220
I run a proper business.

27:17.070 --> 27:18.570
Fair trade.

27:19.510 --> 27:20.620
And now I'm asking you two,

27:21.750 --> 27:22.330
do you get it?

27:22.750 --> 27:23.250
Get it.

27:26.160 --> 27:27.050
Why can't we ever win an argument with him?

27:27.160 --> 27:28.530
You never do.

27:29.160 --> 27:29.940
I just didn't bring my A game today.

27:29.960 --> 27:30.770
A game?

27:30.790 --> 27:31.810
You've got

27:31.830 --> 27:32.650
such a clumsy mouth,

27:32.720 --> 27:33.770
and you think you can out-argue me?

27:33.830 --> 27:35.090
You've got guts!

27:35.510 --> 27:35.810
Hey!

27:36.680 --> 27:37.570
Forget it!

27:37.660 --> 27:38.330
Wait!

27:38.960 --> 27:39.290
Fine.

27:39.680 --> 27:40.750
Business is business.

27:41.510 --> 27:42.660
But doesn't the bond we share

27:43.000 --> 27:44.770
mean more than that?

27:46.400 --> 27:47.730
Ugh, why did you spit?

27:47.750 --> 27:49.160
What's with the attitude?

27:49.830 --> 27:50.660
Have you forgotten?

27:50.790 --> 27:51.520
Back when

27:51.640 --> 27:52.880
Treasure House first opened,

27:53.030 --> 27:54.140
we were the ones

27:54.200 --> 27:55.220
who helped fund it!

27:55.350 --> 27:55.940
Exactly!

27:55.960 --> 27:57.530
You're being ungrateful!

27:57.720 --> 27:58.220
And another thing.

27:58.960 --> 27:59.770
Hongfu!

28:05.550 --> 28:06.380
Why are you just staring?

28:06.780 --> 28:07.860
We're talking to you!

28:09.640 --> 28:11.050
If she hadn't given you

28:11.160 --> 28:12.050
those two Foundation Pills back then,

28:12.070 --> 28:13.860
could you have broken through?

28:14.070 --> 28:14.810
- Exactly! - Yeah.

28:15.350 --> 28:17.700
We agreed that helping fellow disciples comes first.

28:17.830 --> 28:18.900
Money comes second!

28:19.120 --> 28:19.820
- And now... - Yeah!

28:20.350 --> 28:21.290
You've really changed!

28:21.440 --> 28:21.860
Exactly!

28:22.070 --> 28:22.940
Totally changed!

28:24.720 --> 28:25.620
Not completely rotten.

28:25.960 --> 28:26.380
You've got a point.

28:26.720 --> 28:27.220
So,

28:27.310 --> 28:27.860
you...

28:28.110 --> 28:29.660
you can't forget your promise, right?

28:29.680 --> 28:30.090
Am I right?

28:30.110 --> 28:30.900
Your promise!

28:31.110 --> 28:32.530
What happened to your promise?

28:32.880 --> 28:33.700
I lost everything on this.

28:33.720 --> 28:34.700
And you're still talking promises?

28:34.960 --> 28:36.730
You really have the nerve to talk about promises?

28:39.480 --> 28:40.050
Back then,

28:40.590 --> 28:41.770
I couldn't even afford pills.

28:42.830 --> 28:44.330
I got stuck at Foundation Establishment,

28:45.310 --> 28:45.810
while you two

28:46.310 --> 28:47.290
made it to the Core Formation Stage.

28:47.640 --> 28:49.490
Core Formation cultivators like you

28:50.030 --> 28:51.330
don't understand

28:51.640 --> 28:52.420
what low-level cultivators

28:52.750 --> 28:54.900
have to go through.

28:55.510 --> 28:56.420
Speak only when

28:56.640 --> 28:57.730
you know the struggle.

28:58.510 --> 28:58.980
Understand?

28:59.590 --> 29:00.180
Or not?

29:00.640 --> 29:01.090
No!

29:02.790 --> 29:05.570
You dare say you've suffered as a low-level cultivator?

29:05.920 --> 29:06.460
I do.

29:07.000 --> 29:08.730
Add up everything you own!

29:10.110 --> 29:11.050
You're richer

29:11.160 --> 29:12.770
than all of Yellow Maple Valley!

29:12.790 --> 29:13.530
That's mine.

29:13.830 --> 29:15.270
Enough to buy two Clear Void Sects!

29:15.310 --> 29:16.290
Exactly!

29:16.830 --> 29:17.480
Look at you,

29:17.550 --> 29:18.490
"exactly," huh?

29:19.590 --> 29:20.760
Figure out a way

29:20.760 --> 29:22.010
or give it up.

29:27.200 --> 29:27.700
Oh yeah!

29:29.720 --> 29:30.530
I can't take it anymore. And you?

29:30.720 --> 29:31.530
I've been done with him!

29:31.640 --> 29:32.570
Fine.

29:33.510 --> 29:33.980
Today,

29:34.000 --> 29:35.330
I am going to bully you.

29:35.480 --> 29:36.280
I'll show you

29:36.350 --> 29:37.330
what real hardship feels like

29:37.480 --> 29:38.330
for a cultivator!

29:38.590 --> 29:39.660
Core crushing Foundation!

29:39.720 --> 29:40.570
- Get back here! - Come taste the hardship!

29:40.590 --> 29:41.620
- Core crushing Foundation! - Stop right there!

29:41.640 --> 29:42.400
Don't run!

29:42.400 --> 29:43.300
Core crushing Foundation!

29:43.310 --> 29:44.180
Quit running! Face me!

29:44.350 --> 29:45.050
Where's your honor?

29:45.240 --> 29:45.700
Enough!

29:46.750 --> 29:47.250
Huayuan,

29:47.920 --> 29:48.900
show some dignity.

29:51.510 --> 29:52.140
Hongfu's right.

29:52.880 --> 29:53.730
Dignity matters.

29:53.790 --> 29:55.730
- She meant you! - She meant both of you.

29:59.680 --> 30:00.860
Fine, we won't bully you.

30:01.350 --> 30:02.730
How about a little friendly match?

30:04.030 --> 30:05.190
If we win,

30:05.590 --> 30:07.010
you give us those supplies

30:07.590 --> 30:08.250
at half price.

30:08.640 --> 30:09.250
What kind of match?

30:13.350 --> 30:14.290
Mahjong?

30:15.440 --> 30:15.860
Wait.

30:16.790 --> 30:17.250
Are we still using

30:17.590 --> 30:18.220
that same old set?

30:18.550 --> 30:18.980
No, not anymore.

30:19.350 --> 30:19.900
Good.

30:20.030 --> 30:21.460
This one's even better.

30:22.270 --> 30:24.700
It's made from a Tier 4 beast shell,

30:24.880 --> 30:25.810
expertly crafted

30:26.110 --> 30:27.050
over six months

30:27.200 --> 30:28.700
by our sect's top artisan.

30:30.160 --> 30:31.860
Not only insanely durable,

30:32.680 --> 30:33.090
but also

30:33.440 --> 30:35.490
completely blocks spirit sense detection.

30:36.510 --> 30:37.140
That's amazing!

30:37.830 --> 30:38.380
But...

30:38.960 --> 30:39.980
I just did a little divining.

30:40.440 --> 30:41.660
Today's not my lucky day.

30:41.960 --> 30:42.460
I'll lose.

30:42.750 --> 30:43.140
Sorry.

30:43.510 --> 30:44.050
I'm off now.

30:44.960 --> 30:45.620
Hey, Fu Yunzi!

30:46.030 --> 30:46.700
Fu Yunzi!

30:47.270 --> 30:47.900
We're one short!

30:47.960 --> 30:48.810
How are we supposed to play mahjong like this?

30:48.920 --> 30:49.490
Bad hand!

30:49.510 --> 30:51.180
You always win. What are you running from?

30:51.440 --> 30:52.770
- He's always like this. - Bad hand!

30:52.790 --> 30:53.860
And you'd sided with him

30:53.960 --> 30:54.620
against me!

30:54.880 --> 30:55.570
Why?

30:57.790 --> 30:58.530
Don't even bring him up.

30:58.640 --> 30:59.420
You're worse than he is!

31:04.240 --> 31:04.570
All right then.

31:05.550 --> 31:05.980
Let's play.

31:06.920 --> 31:08.460
We're still one short. How?

31:11.830 --> 31:12.570
Wait, it's him?

31:14.350 --> 31:14.900
My name

31:15.030 --> 31:15.490
is Wangyu,

31:15.720 --> 31:17.220
the shopkeeper of Treasure House.

31:18.000 --> 31:18.570
You can call me

31:19.110 --> 31:19.700
Li Feiyu.

31:20.440 --> 31:21.490
With all the disguise I wore that day

31:22.030 --> 31:23.090
and using the name Li Feiyu,

31:23.830 --> 31:24.660
he probably won't recognize me.

31:25.590 --> 31:26.090
I'd better go.

31:29.000 --> 31:29.460
Kid!

31:31.310 --> 31:31.810
Get over here!

31:39.960 --> 31:40.660
Forgot how to play already?

31:40.680 --> 31:41.220
You even know how to play?

31:42.400 --> 31:43.730
Once we start, I'll use Telepathy.

31:43.920 --> 31:45.220
Just pass me whatever tile I want.

31:45.510 --> 31:46.330
- Master... - Let's go.

31:49.880 --> 31:50.570
We've got all four now.

31:51.640 --> 31:52.380
Greetings, Mentor Hongfu.

31:53.480 --> 31:54.330
This is my disciple.

31:56.030 --> 31:56.530
My name is Han Li,

31:56.830 --> 31:57.620
"Li" as in setting up a monument.

31:59.640 --> 32:00.330
This is Wangyu,

32:00.480 --> 32:01.140
"Wang" as in forgetting.

32:01.510 --> 32:02.700
He's the owner of Treasure House.

32:05.590 --> 32:06.010
Enough talk.

32:06.160 --> 32:06.660
We've got four now.

32:06.960 --> 32:07.570
Deal's still on.

32:07.640 --> 32:08.330
If I win,

32:08.350 --> 32:09.620
sell me those talismans at half price.

32:14.960 --> 32:15.460
Go ahead!

32:16.680 --> 32:17.090
Shuffle the tiles!

32:21.720 --> 32:22.380
Xuan'er?

32:23.590 --> 32:24.250
Xuan'er?

32:25.920 --> 32:26.460
Xuan'er?

32:26.550 --> 32:27.090
Senior Wu!

32:27.440 --> 32:28.220
Have you seen Xuan'er?

32:28.550 --> 32:29.220
I'm looking for her.

32:29.480 --> 32:29.980
No.

32:39.830 --> 32:40.250
It's from Xuan'er...

32:45.510 --> 32:45.980
Too bad.

33:04.750 --> 33:05.730
Pung!

33:14.590 --> 33:15.010
Chow!

33:20.510 --> 33:21.090
Han Li,

33:21.270 --> 33:23.250
it's only been a year,

33:23.790 --> 33:25.420
and you're already at Mid Foundation Stage?

33:25.960 --> 33:27.050
Your cultivation

33:27.480 --> 33:28.490
has grown this fast.

33:29.440 --> 33:30.180
You flatter me, Mentor.

33:31.400 --> 33:32.620
It was pure luck.

33:32.920 --> 33:34.010
I got my hands on a few enhancement pills.

33:35.440 --> 33:35.810
However,

33:35.960 --> 33:36.530
my foundation's still unstable.

33:36.920 --> 33:37.700
I've got to keep training hard.

33:38.790 --> 33:39.620
See? I told you

33:39.640 --> 33:41.140
this kid's lucky,

33:41.240 --> 33:42.140
knows how to pick his moments.

33:42.310 --> 33:42.900
He's just like me,

33:43.030 --> 33:44.050
matured and composed.

33:48.160 --> 33:49.050
- Draw. - Why are you laughing?

33:50.680 --> 33:51.090
Oh...

33:52.750 --> 33:53.420
That's not true.

33:54.000 --> 33:54.570
What's that supposed to mean?

33:55.160 --> 33:56.810
Just saying luck alone already makes him

33:57.070 --> 33:58.050
better than you.

33:58.880 --> 33:59.420
Much better.

34:01.440 --> 34:01.940
Hu! (Winning call)

34:02.720 --> 34:03.940
You rip-off!

34:04.030 --> 34:05.180
Can't you give it a rest?

34:06.400 --> 34:07.580
How are you winning again?

34:07.880 --> 34:09.040
The three of you keep passing tiles,

34:09.110 --> 34:09.730
passing and passing!

34:09.790 --> 34:10.620
Aren't you done messing around?

34:10.960 --> 34:12.250
You think I can't see that?

34:12.790 --> 34:13.420
Who passed tiles?

34:13.550 --> 34:14.380
Who did that?

34:14.790 --> 34:15.420
Come on,

34:15.570 --> 34:16.030
deal the next round!

34:16.510 --> 34:17.380
We didn't even get the price down.

34:17.640 --> 34:18.330
You're not going anywhere!

34:18.680 --> 34:20.140
Just for saving a few gems,

34:20.160 --> 34:21.010
you really don't value your life, huh?

34:21.160 --> 34:22.090
I can't just back out now!

34:22.110 --> 34:22.810
Fine! Half price!

34:23.720 --> 34:24.090
What?

34:24.270 --> 34:24.570
No joke?

34:24.750 --> 34:25.330
Half price for you.

34:25.800 --> 34:26.380
Seriously?

34:28.680 --> 34:29.530
You better not go back on your word!

34:29.550 --> 34:30.220
Go back on what?

34:30.240 --> 34:31.010
I said half!

34:31.030 --> 34:31.620
You'll get half off!

34:32.340 --> 34:33.160
Now that's more like it.

34:33.160 --> 34:33.960
Using Telepathy, huh?

34:33.960 --> 34:35.810
You're way too obvious with the cheating.

34:51.960 --> 34:52.810
Honestly,

34:53.590 --> 34:54.860
I kind of envy you.

34:57.270 --> 34:58.940
I may be a Core Formation cultivator now,

35:01.160 --> 35:04.010
but I still can't act on every whim or desire, or make peace with myself.

35:04.920 --> 35:06.090
What's the point

35:06.440 --> 35:07.250
of all this cultivation

35:08.030 --> 35:08.770
if I can't follow my heart?

35:09.640 --> 35:10.700
Look at you,

35:11.070 --> 35:12.090
all that sighing

35:12.110 --> 35:12.940
and glooming around.

35:12.960 --> 35:13.860
What's the point?

35:14.880 --> 35:16.140
Focus on something real.

35:16.830 --> 35:18.420
Your feelings for Hongfu

35:18.440 --> 35:19.490
are written all over your face.

35:20.680 --> 35:22.420
Even louder than that Telepathy of yours!

35:23.030 --> 35:24.010
You should go after her!

35:24.550 --> 35:26.180
Chase hard!

35:30.200 --> 35:31.850
Who knows when we'll get another round like this?

35:31.850 --> 35:33.010
Maybe centuries from now.

35:35.790 --> 35:36.220
All right.

35:37.030 --> 35:37.570
I'm off.

35:39.750 --> 35:40.430
Keep your eyes open

35:40.430 --> 35:41.050
on the battlefield.

35:51.590 --> 35:52.980
I said I'm leaving.

35:53.550 --> 35:54.460
Aren't you going to see me off?

35:55.230 --> 35:56.300
You already got the price down.

35:56.320 --> 35:57.380
What's left to see off?

35:57.550 --> 35:58.300
Take care, then!

35:59.710 --> 36:00.460
You old gambling addict.

36:10.440 --> 36:10.780
Mentor.

36:12.070 --> 36:13.740
Master asked me to see you off on his behalf.

36:16.480 --> 36:17.900
I won't let you leave empty-handed.

36:18.920 --> 36:19.300
Here.

36:21.480 --> 36:22.090
This is

36:22.510 --> 36:24.570
a VIP token for Treasure House.

36:26.230 --> 36:27.940
With this,

36:28.070 --> 36:29.380
any treasure in our shops,

36:30.360 --> 36:30.940
you get 10% off.

36:32.320 --> 36:32.940
Thank you, Mentor!

36:34.550 --> 36:34.980
Look at me.

36:37.510 --> 36:39.690
Li Feiyu!

36:41.440 --> 36:42.460
I didn't expect this.

36:42.590 --> 36:44.530
You already reached Mid Foundation Establishment

36:44.840 --> 36:46.090
after all these years apart?

36:46.400 --> 36:47.150
Not bad at all.

36:48.000 --> 36:48.980
Still, in cultivation,

36:49.360 --> 36:51.050
you can't rush the process.

36:51.360 --> 36:52.130
You have to

36:52.280 --> 36:53.940
lay a solid foundation.

36:58.710 --> 36:59.210
No worries.

37:00.590 --> 37:02.300
Who doesn't have a few secrets?

37:02.960 --> 37:05.300
Next time you come across rare spirit herbs,

37:06.400 --> 37:08.610
always trade with me.

37:14.320 --> 37:15.010
Old gambling addict!

37:15.710 --> 37:17.570
It's my first time meeting your disciple today.

37:18.030 --> 37:19.010
I actually like him!

37:19.840 --> 37:21.050
Following you around won't get him far.

37:21.510 --> 37:22.170
Why not let him

37:22.230 --> 37:23.690
work in my shop as an apprentice?

37:23.880 --> 37:24.460
What do you say?

37:25.600 --> 37:26.530
You rip-off!

37:27.280 --> 37:29.130
Now you're trying to poach my disciple?

37:29.630 --> 37:30.090
Get lost!

37:30.920 --> 37:31.740
Don't let me see your face again!

37:32.150 --> 37:32.900
So stingy!

37:41.670 --> 37:42.340
That Wangyu guy

37:42.630 --> 37:43.340
is really shameless.

37:44.030 --> 37:45.530
Core beating Foundation?

37:45.710 --> 37:47.490
Weaker or not, I'd still beat him.

37:48.070 --> 37:48.820
The worst part is,

37:48.880 --> 37:50.380
he had the nerve to hide behind you!

37:50.480 --> 37:50.980
Seriously!

37:52.840 --> 37:53.530
All I know is,

37:53.710 --> 37:54.940
if I drag him to the mahjong table,

37:55.070 --> 37:56.090
he's going down!

37:57.400 --> 37:57.980
Wake up!

37:58.150 --> 37:58.740
Who lost?

37:58.800 --> 38:00.010
It was the three of us who lost!

38:00.800 --> 38:02.050
He gave us a discount.

38:02.110 --> 38:03.170
He's the real loser.

38:04.320 --> 38:05.780
That guy's got heart.

38:06.000 --> 38:07.490
He didn't have to do that.

38:07.510 --> 38:07.980
Right!

38:08.510 --> 38:08.980
That rip-off

38:09.150 --> 38:09.530
was pretty decent this time.

38:10.510 --> 38:11.740
With this new batch of supplies,

38:12.070 --> 38:13.570
our disciples' survival rate will go way up.

38:13.760 --> 38:14.170
Exactly.

38:14.760 --> 38:16.610
Even basic Freezing Talismans

38:16.960 --> 38:18.820
can save a life in the right moment.

38:19.670 --> 38:20.170
Yeah!

38:20.710 --> 38:22.380
So we owe him big now.

38:22.760 --> 38:24.300
And you didn't even bother to see him off?

38:25.920 --> 38:26.570
I tried.

38:26.630 --> 38:27.530
He wouldn't let me.

38:27.760 --> 38:29.340
And you just gave up?

38:29.630 --> 38:30.570
Next time we see him

38:30.590 --> 38:31.980
may be centuries from now.

38:32.630 --> 38:33.940
You said that too?

38:35.280 --> 38:36.090
That's exactly what he said.

38:36.110 --> 38:38.170
Who knows how many centuries until the next game?

38:38.400 --> 38:39.650
Can you all stop saying stuff like that?

38:40.110 --> 38:40.570
It just

38:40.670 --> 38:41.260
doesn't sit right.

38:41.670 --> 38:42.740
Let's hope

38:42.800 --> 38:43.860
the war ends soon.

38:44.440 --> 38:44.860
Then,

38:45.070 --> 38:46.340
we can invite Wangyu

38:46.800 --> 38:47.460
and Fu Yunzi

38:47.760 --> 38:48.780
to Yellow Maple Valley

38:48.800 --> 38:49.570
for a proper gathering.

38:51.710 --> 38:52.130
Sounds good.

38:52.550 --> 38:53.170
You're agreeing?

38:54.840 --> 38:55.610
Of course I am!

38:56.880 --> 38:58.260
That sneaky brat Wangyu,

38:58.440 --> 38:58.940
seriously!

38:59.480 --> 39:00.420
He had the nerve to say

39:01.070 --> 39:03.780
my feelings were louder than the Telepathy.

39:05.070 --> 39:05.740
Feelings?

39:06.190 --> 39:07.050
What feelings can you possibly have?

39:08.480 --> 39:09.460
What feelings?

39:10.190 --> 39:11.420
I've only ever had one feeling.

39:13.480 --> 39:14.210
Then I already know.

39:15.710 --> 39:16.300
You do?

39:18.760 --> 39:19.740
Achieve true peace.

39:24.280 --> 39:25.300
Something like that.

39:26.760 --> 39:27.130
Master!

39:27.670 --> 39:28.140
Master!

39:28.230 --> 39:28.860
- What is it? - Bad news!

39:30.030 --> 39:30.650
Why the panic?

39:30.880 --> 39:31.570
Master, Mentor,

39:31.840 --> 39:33.380
I found this on the battlefield.

39:33.760 --> 39:34.640
It's Xuan'er's hair ribbon!

39:36.110 --> 39:36.860
What's going on?

39:37.320 --> 39:38.650
She left this morning alone,

39:38.760 --> 39:39.460
and didn't let me follow her.

39:39.840 --> 39:40.530
Several hours passed,

39:40.670 --> 39:41.340
and she still hadn't returned.

39:41.480 --> 39:42.170
I went looking,

39:42.510 --> 39:43.380
and found her ribbon.

39:43.920 --> 39:44.420
That area

39:44.550 --> 39:45.340
had demonic sect activity.

39:45.800 --> 39:47.570
We can't let Xuan'er fall into his hands.

39:48.550 --> 39:49.420
I'm going after her!

39:50.150 --> 39:51.040
I'll come with you!

39:51.040 --> 39:52.170
No! You can't!

39:52.440 --> 39:52.940
Stay and hold the line!

39:53.670 --> 39:54.130
Then...

39:54.800 --> 39:56.940
if you need backup, send word right away!

39:58.710 --> 40:00.340
- Don't just stand there. Go with her! - Yes, sir!

40:08.510 --> 40:09.650
Did you see Wangyu off?

40:10.150 --> 40:10.650
He's gone.

40:11.760 --> 40:12.420
Did he say anything?

40:14.760 --> 40:15.650
He said he'd miss you all.

40:18.400 --> 40:19.130
That's it?

40:23.000 --> 40:24.050
Oh, and he gave me a token.

40:24.590 --> 40:25.170
With it,

40:25.230 --> 40:26.010
we can get 10% off.

40:26.840 --> 40:27.420
Let me see.

40:29.590 --> 40:30.420
Stingy guy.

40:30.670 --> 40:31.460
Only 10%?

40:32.280 --> 40:32.780
Just keep it.

40:34.760 --> 40:35.540
Anyway, I called you here

40:35.550 --> 40:36.210
for something else.

40:37.030 --> 40:38.090
I need you to go to the capital.

40:39.150 --> 40:39.650
The capital?

40:39.880 --> 40:40.300
Yes.

40:41.510 --> 40:43.090
Back when I was your age,

40:43.320 --> 40:44.260
I had a senior brother

40:45.150 --> 40:46.460
who once saved my life.

40:46.760 --> 40:47.300
But sadly,

40:47.510 --> 40:49.170
he died during a trial.

40:50.400 --> 40:52.420
He left behind a son with no spirit root,

40:52.760 --> 40:53.380
just a mortal.

40:54.440 --> 40:55.530
I swore an oath

40:56.480 --> 40:57.490
to ensure that his family line

40:57.510 --> 40:59.690
would always live in wealth and peace.

41:00.150 --> 41:00.780
Now,

41:01.190 --> 41:02.650
they've since settled in the capital.

41:03.440 --> 41:05.570
It should be the fourth generation by now.

41:07.190 --> 41:08.980
Ordinarily, mortal affairs are untouched

41:09.030 --> 41:10.380
by cultivation wars.

41:11.840 --> 41:12.610
But this time is different.

41:13.550 --> 41:14.570
The demonic sects have already attacked

41:14.760 --> 41:16.170
Jiang and Cheqi Kingdoms.

41:17.360 --> 41:18.340
I'm afraid

41:18.880 --> 41:20.050
they'll target

41:20.150 --> 41:21.900
the secular world in Yue next.

41:24.000 --> 41:25.050
And if I recall,

41:25.840 --> 41:27.340
you're from Yue Kingdom, right?

41:29.360 --> 41:29.740
Master,

41:30.630 --> 41:31.820
I once made a mistake in cultivation,

41:32.230 --> 41:33.010
and lost some of my memory.

41:34.670 --> 41:35.460
I truly don't remember

41:35.630 --> 41:36.650
where I was born.

41:40.150 --> 41:41.610
Everyone in the cultivation world

41:41.630 --> 41:42.650
has secrets of their own.

41:43.000 --> 41:44.090
No need to explain too much.

41:44.880 --> 41:45.940
Just like your origins,

41:46.230 --> 41:47.490
I've never asked about.

41:47.960 --> 41:48.380
Right?

41:49.630 --> 41:50.570
All I'm asking

41:50.710 --> 41:52.420
is for you to go to the capital in my place.

41:52.590 --> 41:53.300
If the demonic sects

41:53.710 --> 41:54.490
make a move,

41:55.190 --> 41:55.780
I want you

41:55.800 --> 41:57.570
to protect that family.

41:58.880 --> 41:59.610
Heading to Yue's interior

42:00.280 --> 42:01.860
is a great chance to withdraw from the war.

42:02.550 --> 42:03.210
A chance worth taking.

42:05.000 --> 42:06.490
Here's the Qin family genealogy.

42:06.590 --> 42:07.050
Take it.

42:09.190 --> 42:11.940
This is a personal favor.

42:12.880 --> 42:14.780
Our sect forbids interference

42:14.920 --> 42:15.690
in mortal affairs.

42:16.440 --> 42:17.820
You understand what I mean.

42:24.440 --> 42:24.900
Yes, Master.

42:25.070 --> 42:26.170
I'll carry out the task in secret.

42:27.230 --> 42:27.980
But...

42:31.030 --> 42:31.650
But right now,

42:32.110 --> 42:33.490
the Seven Sects are standing against the demonic sects.

42:34.230 --> 42:35.780
It's our time to fight for righteousness.

42:36.480 --> 42:37.900
What's this brat scheming now?

42:38.070 --> 42:38.940
He never acts without a motive.

42:40.070 --> 42:41.380
I still haven't spent all my war credits.

42:42.150 --> 42:42.650
Leaving now

42:43.000 --> 42:44.050
will mean a huge loss!

42:46.550 --> 42:47.650
I just won't feel right

42:48.710 --> 42:50.050
abandoning my post now.

42:52.150 --> 42:53.490
The Seven Sects are vast.

42:54.590 --> 42:55.780
Even if the battle gets bloody,

42:56.030 --> 42:58.380
they won't miss one Foundation Establishment cultivator.

42:58.670 --> 42:59.420
But Master,

42:59.880 --> 43:01.380
those demonic bastards are getting bolder.

43:01.630 --> 43:02.570
They think the Seven Sects are helpless!

43:02.710 --> 43:03.170
Enough!

43:03.480 --> 43:04.420
You're the most level-headed

43:04.710 --> 43:05.460
of my disciples.

43:05.880 --> 43:07.380
That's why I trust you with this task.

43:07.630 --> 43:08.210
It's settled.

43:09.960 --> 43:10.530
But honestly,

43:11.710 --> 43:12.860
I earned quite a bit of war credits

43:12.880 --> 43:14.050
at Golden Drum Plains.

43:14.760 --> 43:15.570
If I stay longer,

43:16.110 --> 43:17.090
I'll earn even more merits

43:18.150 --> 43:19.460
and trade them for great rewards.

43:20.550 --> 43:22.170
He really knows how to bargain

43:22.190 --> 43:23.260
at a time like this...

43:26.190 --> 43:26.900
Fine!

43:27.360 --> 43:27.860
Here's the deal.

43:28.550 --> 43:29.130
We'll consider

43:29.190 --> 43:29.860
this mission

43:30.400 --> 43:30.740
an official duty

43:30.920 --> 43:31.490
for the sect.

43:32.280 --> 43:33.340
As for your war credits,

43:34.030 --> 43:34.610
I'll handle it personally.

43:34.960 --> 43:35.690
You'll get your full share.

43:36.070 --> 43:36.490
Happy now?

43:37.960 --> 43:38.490
Master,

43:38.710 --> 43:39.660
you're so kind and generous,

43:40.280 --> 43:40.940
and you always keep your word.

43:41.360 --> 43:42.900
I won't let you down!

43:47.360 --> 43:49.300
Look at your little schemes.

43:50.440 --> 43:51.170
But I like that.

43:51.710 --> 43:53.570
That's why I trust you with this.

43:55.230 --> 43:56.610
I'll write a letter.

43:56.960 --> 43:58.820
Give it to the current head of the Qin family.

44:00.030 --> 44:00.900
If anyone asks you anything,

44:01.360 --> 44:01.940
don't explain.

44:04.070 --> 44:04.980
You've always been cautious.

44:05.440 --> 44:06.460
I don't need to say much more.

44:08.230 --> 44:09.170
Take this Telepathy Talisman.

44:10.190 --> 44:10.820
If anything happens,

44:11.150 --> 44:11.740
send me a message.

44:12.760 --> 44:15.090
Nangong of Moonshadow Sect

44:15.920 --> 44:16.900
is passing through the area.

44:17.670 --> 44:18.900
I've already spoken to her.

44:19.110 --> 44:20.650
Take the Celestial Moon Ark with them.

44:23.230 --> 44:24.300
Act alongside them.

44:24.590 --> 44:25.460
It'll help you stay out of sight.

44:26.510 --> 44:27.130
She...

44:44.940 --> 44:50.260
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

44:51.500 --> 44:56.900
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

44:57.020 --> 45:00.220
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

45:00.460 --> 45:02.700
♪Old scenes rise again♪

45:03.100 --> 45:05.940
♪Too hard to forget♪

45:06.460 --> 45:10.420
♪Easier just to miss♪

45:11.260 --> 45:16.740
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

45:17.900 --> 45:23.180
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

45:23.780 --> 45:26.820
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

45:27.100 --> 45:29.220
♪Swept away by time♪

45:29.860 --> 45:32.500
♪Eyes once looked far♪

45:32.980 --> 45:36.940
♪Now lost in the shift♪

45:37.420 --> 45:40.260
♪Autumn winds stir♪

45:40.540 --> 45:42.460
♪Smoke curls once more♪

45:42.900 --> 45:45.340
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

45:45.660 --> 45:49.180
♪Returning to my eyes♪

45:49.740 --> 45:52.700
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

45:53.020 --> 45:55.940
♪Time lost its name♪

45:56.340 --> 45:59.180
♪Was it yesterday♪

45:59.580 --> 46:03.140
♪Or tomorrow?♪

46:03.500 --> 46:06.340
♪The world has changed♪

46:06.740 --> 46:08.580
♪Beyond recall♪

46:09.140 --> 46:10.860
♪Time will fade♪

46:11.260 --> 46:16.060
♪All the words ever spoken♪

46:16.740 --> 46:19.620
♪Only this longing remains♪

46:20.100 --> 46:25.380
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

46:26.500 --> 46:33.140
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

46:33.620 --> 46:43.340
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
